user_prompt:
Evaluate this story's viral potential using the 7-dimension framework:

**Story Title**: {{title}}
**Genre**: {{genre}}
**Target Audience**: {{target_audience}}
**Target Duration**: {{target_duration}} seconds

**Story Text**:
{{story_text}}

Evaluate each of the 7 viral dimensions honestly. Cite specific lines or moments from the story when scoring. Compute the weighted overall score. Return your evaluation as JSON.

```json
{
  "evaluation": {
    "title": "string",
    "overallScore": number (0.0–1.0, weighted average),
    "decision": "pass | revise | major-rewrite",
    "dimensions": {
      "hookStrength": {
        "score": number (0.0–1.0),
        "evidence": "Quote or describe the opening moment that was evaluated",
        "feedback": "What's working, what to improve"
      },
      "curiosityGap": {
        "score": number,
        "evidence": "The central mystery as it currently exists in the story",
        "feedback": "string"
      },
      "emotionalArc": {
        "score": number,
        "phases": ["act 1 emotion", "act 2 emotion", "act 3 emotion"],
        "feedback": "string"
      },
      "setupPayoff": {
        "score": number,
        "setup": "The planted detail or element in Act 1",
        "payoff": "How it resolves in Act 3 (or 'none found')",
        "feedback": "string"
      },
      "dialogueSubtext": {
        "score": number,
        "worstOffender": "The most on-the-nose line in the story (or 'none found')",
        "feedback": "string"
      },
      "loopability": {
        "score": number,
        "openingBeat": "The story's opening image or moment",
        "closingBeat": "The story's ending image or moment",
        "feedback": "string"
      },
      "memorableMoment": {
        "score": number,
        "candidateScene": "The best candidate for the must-describe-to-someone moment",
        "feedback": "string"
      }
    },
    "topPriorities": [
      "string — the single most important fix",
      "string — second most important fix",
      "string — third most important fix"
    ],
    "strengths": ["string — what's already working well"]
  }
}
```
